---
const seasons = [["/images/agriculture/setva.webp", "Setva", "Traktor u setvi pored sela"], ["/images/agriculture/zetva.webp", "Žetva", "Kombajn u zrelom žitu"], ["/images/agriculture/berba.webp", "Berba", "Berba kukuruza u jesen"], ["/images/agriculture/zima.webp", "Zima i stočarstvo", "Stoka na gazdinstvu zimi"]];
---
<section id="pocetna" class="relative isolate overflow-hidden"><img src="/images/hero/zetva.webp" alt="Kombajn u žetvi pšenice" class="absolute inset-0 -z-20 size-full object-cover object-center" /><div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#26311ce8] via-[#26311cb8] to-[#26311c3d]"></div><div class="shell flex min-h-[38rem] items-center py-24 md:min-h-[42rem]"><div class="max-w-2xl text-white"><p class="eyebrow !text-[#edc973]">Vaš stručni konsultant · Šabac</p><h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.08] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">Podrška savremenoj poljoprivredi</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/90">Informacije, stručna podrška i digitalni alati za poljoprivredu. Pomažemo gazdinstvima da lakše dođu do informacija o podsticajima, finansiranju i administrativnim postupcima — i da kroz njih prođu bez nepotrebnog gubljenja vremena.</p><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://agrobim.digital" class="focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gold px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-[#382d16] transition hover:bg-[#f0bc53]">Aktuelni podsticaji <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="#usluge" class="focus-ring inline-flex rounded-full border border-white/65 bg-white/10 px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold transition hover:bg-white/20">Naše usluge</a></div></div></div></section>
<section class="border-b border-line bg-sand" aria-labelledby="sezone-title"><div class="shell py-12 md:py-16"><p id="sezone-title" class="eyebrow">Uz vas kroz celu godinu</p><div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">{seasons.map(([src, label, alt]) => <figure><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl"><img src={src} alt={alt} loading="lazy" class="h-36 w-full object-cover transition duration-500 hover:scale-105 md:h-44" /></div><figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-muted-ink">{label}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></div></section>
